# Render Deployment Environment Variables

## Server Configuration
NODE_ENV=production
PORT=3000
LCG_ENABLE_DEBUG_TOOLS=false

## Client Configuration (for development overrides)
VITE_SERVER_URL=http://localhost:3001
VITE_ENABLE_DEBUG_TOOLS=false

## Optional: Custom client URL for CORS
CLIENT_URL=https://yourdomain-on-render.app
